Description: VeltOS Notepad, a Windows 11 style text editor
 Plain text editing in the layout of Windows 11's Notepad: tabs in the
 title bar, File, Edit and View menus, find and replace, go to line,
 time and date, zoom, word wrap and a status bar with the line, column,
 characters, line ending and encoding.
 .
 Files keep their encoding (UTF-8, UTF-8 with BOM, UTF-16, ANSI) and line
 endings (Windows, Unix, Macintosh). Like Windows 11, unsaved tabs come
 back the next time Notepad starts, and opening another file adds a tab
 to the running Notepad.
